{"sha": "5b9f990cc419641f951848e7bc4d78e0c2ab66cbdbc5e140b97f2b279aa8b58a", "body": ["\\begin{definition}[升降算符]\\label{def:b3:quantum-model-systems:ladder}", "设 $x_0 = \\sqrt{\\hbar/m\\omega}$，称\\emph{升降算符}\\index{升降算符}", "为", "\\[", "\\hat a = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\Big(\\frac{\\hat x}{x_0} + \\frac{\\iu x_0\\hat p}{\\hbar}\\Big),", "\\qquad \\hat a^\\dagger = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\Big(\\frac{\\hat x}{x_0} -", "\\frac{\\iu x_0\\hat p}{\\hbar}\\Big).", "\\]", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[谐振子的能级]\\label{thm:b3:quantum-model-systems:oscillator}", "谐振子的能级为", "\\[", "E_v = \\big(v + \\tfrac12\\big)\\hbar\\omega = \\big(v + \\tfrac12\\big)h\\nu, \\qquad v =", "0, 1, 2, \\dots,", "\\]", "能级等间距，间距为 $h\\nu$，零点能为 $\\frac12h\\nu$。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "由 $[\\hat x,\\hat p] = \\iu\\hbar$ 可得 $[\\hat a,\\hat a^\\dagger] = 1$ 及", "$\\hat H = \\hbar\\omega(\\hat a^\\dagger\\hat a + \\frac12)$。记 $\\hat N =", "\\hat a^\\dagger\\hat a$。则 $[\\hat N,\\hat a] = -\\hat a$，$[\\hat N,\\hat", "a^\\dagger] = \\hat a^\\dagger$：若 $\\hat N\\psi = \\nu\\psi$，则 $\\hat N(\\hat", "a\\psi) = (\\nu - 1)\\hat a\\psi$，$\\hat N(\\hat a^\\dagger\\psi) = (\\nu + 1)\\hat", "a^\\dagger\\psi$；$\\hat a$ 使本征值降低一，$\\hat a^\\dagger$ 使其", "升高。又 $\\nu = \\langle\\psi|\\hat a^\\dagger\\hat a\\psi\\rangle/\\langle\\psi|\\psi", "\\rangle = \\|\\hat a\\psi\\|^2/\\|\\psi\\|^2 \\ge 0$：降阶必须终止，这只能", "发生于满足 $\\hat a\\psi_0 = 0$ 的函数上，其本征值为 $\\nu = 0$。", "因此 $\\hat N$ 的本征值为 $v = 0, 1, 2, \\dots$，$\\hat H$ 的本征值为", "$(v + \\frac12)\\hbar\\omega$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[最初几个波函数]\\label{prop:b3:quantum-model-systems:oscillator-functions}", "取约化坐标 $y = x/x_0$，则", "\\[", "\\psi_0 \\propto \\eu^{-y^2/2}, \\quad \\psi_1 \\propto 2y\\,\\eu^{-y^2/2}, \\quad", "\\psi_2 \\propto (4y^2 - 2)\\eu^{-y^2/2}, \\quad \\psi_3 \\propto (8y^3 -", "12y)\\eu^{-y^2/2},", "\\]", "这些函数是厄米多项式乘以高斯函数。$\\psi_v$ 在 $v$ 为偶数时为偶函数，", "$v$ 为奇数时为奇函数。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$\\hat a\\psi_0 = 0$ 即 $y\\psi_0 + \\dd\\psi_0/\\dd y = 0$，其解为", "高斯函数。每个后续函数都是对前一个函数作用 $\\hat a^\\dagger$ 所得，", "$\\hat a^\\dagger = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}(y - \\dd/\\dd y)$，它使", "多项式乘以 $2y$ 并减去其导数：$1 \\to 2y \\to 4y^2 - 2 \\to", "8y^3 - 12y$（相差因子除外）。将 $y$ 换为 $-y$ 时，改变 $y$ 的符号，", "$\\dd/\\dd y$ 的符号亦随之改变，因此 $\\hat a^\\dagger$ 每作用一次宇称便翻转一次。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[width=0.66\\linewidth, height=6.6cm, xmin=-4, xmax=4, ymin=0,", "  ymax=4.6, axis lines=left, xlabel={$y = x/x_0$},", "  ylabel={能量 / $\\hbar\\omega$}, ytick={0.5,1.5,2.5,3.5},", "  tick label style={font=\\small}, label style={font=\\small}]", "\\addplot[black, thick] table[x=y, y=V] {figdata/out/bachelor-3-harmonic-oscillator.dat};", "\\foreach \\v in {0.5,1.5,2.5,3.5}{\\addplot[gray!50, dashed, domain=-4:4] {\\v};}", "\\addplot[omDef, thick] table[x=y, y=p0] {figdata/out/bachelor-3-harmonic-oscillator.dat};", "\\addplot[omDef, thick] table[x=y, y=p1] {figdata/out/bachelor-3-harmonic-oscillator.dat};", "\\addplot[omDef, thick] table[x=y, y=p2] {figdata/out/bachelor-3-harmonic-oscillator.dat};", "\\addplot[omDef, thick] table[x=y, y=p3] {figdata/out/bachelor-3-harmonic-oscillator.dat};", "\\addplot[only marks, mark=*, mark size=1.6pt, omThm] coordinates {(-1,0.5) (1,0.5)};", "\\node[omThm, font=\\small, anchor=west] at (axis cs:2.0,0.2) {转折点};", "\\draw[omThm, ->, thin] (axis cs:2.0,0.2) -- (axis cs:1.08,0.47);", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 谐振子势、其前四个能级及波函数，", "每个波函数都画在其能级上。波函数延伸到经典", "转折点之外（$y = \\pm1$，对应 $v = 0$，即红点），此处经典", "粒子会停下。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[\\ce{H2} 与 \\ce{D2} 的零点能]\\label{ex:b3:quantum-model-systems:zpe}", "% ledger: diat:H2.we, diat:D2.we", "\\ce{H2} 的谐振波数为 $\\tilde\\omega_e = \\qty{4401.2}{cm^{-1}}$，", "\\ce{D2} 为 \\qty{3115.5}{cm^{-1}}，二者之比为 $1.413$，接近", "$\\sqrt2$：键与力常数相同，约化质量加倍。谐振", "零点能为上述值的一半，即 2200.6 与 \\qty{1557.8}{cm^{-1}}，", "\\qty{26.3}{kJ/mol} 与 \\qty{18.6}{kJ/mol}。分子永远无法失去", "这部分能量；同位素之间的差异正是", "\\cref{ch:b3:statistical-thermo-applied,ch:b3:rate-theories}中同位素效应的来源。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{刚性转子}", "", "双原子分子还会绕其质心转动。将其视为两个", "相距固定距离 $r$ 的质点，它便是转动惯量为", "$I = \\mu r^2$ 的刚性转子，其中约化质量位于距转轴 $r$ 处。", "", "\\begin{definition}[刚性转子、球谐函数]\\label{def:b3:quantum-model-systems:rotor}", "\\emph{刚性转子}\\index{刚性转子}是形状固定、可自由转动的物体；", "对线性分子，$\\hat H = \\hat L^2/2I$，其中 $\\hat L^2$ 为", "角动量平方的算符。其本征函数", "仅依赖于角度 $\\theta$ 与 $\\phi$，即\\emph{球谐", "函数}\\index{球谐函数} $Y_{l,m}(\\theta,\\phi)$，由 $l =", "0, 1, 2, \\dots$ 与 $m = -l, \\dots, l$ 标记；对分子而言，$l$ 记为 $J$。", "\\end{definition}", "", "环上的转子（在平面内绕固定轴转动）先求解，", "它包含了主要思想。", "", "\\begin{theorem}[环]\\label{thm:b3:quantum-model-systems:ring}", "转动惯量为 $I$、在平面内转动的粒子，其能级为", "$E_m = m^2\\hbar^2/2I$，$m = 0, \\pm1, \\pm2, \\dots$；除 $m = 0$ 外，", "其余能级均为二重简并。", "\\end{theorem}", ""]}